{"page":354,"verses":[{"verse_key":"24:32","surah":24,"ayah":32,"ar_uthmani":"وَأَنكِحُوا۟ ٱلْأَيَـٰمَىٰ مِنكُمْ وَٱلصَّـٰلِحِينَ مِنْ عِبَادِكُمْ وَإِمَآئِكُمْ ۚ إِن يَكُونُوا۟ فُقَرَآءَ يُغْنِهِمُ ٱللَّهُ مِن فَضْلِهِۦ ۗ وَٱللَّهُ وَٰسِعٌ عَلِيمٌ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Marry off the single among you and those of your male and female slaves who are fit [for marriage]. If they are poor, God will provide for them from His bounty: God’s bounty is infinite and He is all knowing.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَأَنكِحُوا۟","en_gloss":"And marry","transliteration":"wa-ankiḥū","verse_key":"24:32"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلْأَيَـٰمَىٰ","en_gloss":"the single","transliteration":"l-ayāmā","verse_key":"24:32"},{"pos":3,"ar":"مِنكُمْ","en_gloss":"among you","transliteration":"minkum","verse_key":"24:32"},{"pos":4,"ar":"وَٱلصَّـٰلِحِينَ","en_gloss":"and the righteous","transliteration":"wal-ṣāliḥīna","verse_key":"24:32"},{"pos":5,"ar":"مِنْ","en_gloss":"among","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"24:32"},{"pos":6,"ar":"عِبَادِكُمْ","en_gloss":"your male slaves","transliteration":"ʿibādikum","verse_key":"24:32"},{"pos":7,"ar":"وَإِمَآئِكُمْ ۚ","en_gloss":"and your female slaves","transliteration":"wa-imāikum","verse_key":"24:32"},{"pos":8,"ar":"إِن","en_gloss":"If","transliteration":"in","verse_key":"24:32"},{"pos":9,"ar":"يَكُونُوا۟","en_gloss":"they are","transliteration":"yakūnū","verse_key":"24:32"},{"pos":10,"ar":"فُقَرَآءَ","en_gloss":"poor","transliteration":"fuqarāa","verse_key":"24:32"},{"pos":11,"ar":"يُغْنِهِمُ","en_gloss":"Allah will enrich them","transliteration":"yugh'nihimu","verse_key":"24:32"},{"pos":12,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"Allah will enrich them","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"24:32"},{"pos":13,"ar":"مِن","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"24:32"},{"pos":14,"ar":"فَضْلِهِۦ ۗ","en_gloss":"His Bounty","transliteration":"faḍlihi","verse_key":"24:32"},{"pos":15,"ar":"وَٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"And Allah","transliteration":"wal-lahu","verse_key":"24:32"},{"pos":16,"ar":"وَٰسِعٌ","en_gloss":"(is) All-Encompassing","transliteration":"wāsiʿun","verse_key":"24:32"},{"pos":17,"ar":"عَلِيمٌۭ","en_gloss":"All-Knowing","transliteration":"ʿalīmun","verse_key":"24:32"},{"pos":18,"ar":"٣٢","en_gloss":"(32)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"24:32"}]},{"verse_key":"24:33","surah":24,"ayah":33,"ar_uthmani":"وَلْيَسْتَعْفِفِ ٱلَّذِينَ لَا يَجِدُونَ نِكَاحًا حَتَّىٰ يُغْنِيَهُمُ ٱللَّهُ مِن فَضْلِهِۦ ۗ وَٱلَّذِينَ يَبْتَغُونَ ٱلْكِتَـٰبَ مِمَّا مَلَكَتْ أَيْمَـٰنُكُمْ فَكَاتِبُوهُمْ إِنْ عَلِمْتُمْ فِيهِمْ خَيْرًا ۖ وَءَاتُوهُم مِّن مَّالِ ٱللَّهِ ٱلَّذِىٓ ءَاتَىٰكُمْ ۚ وَلَا تُكْرِهُوا۟ فَتَيَـٰتِكُمْ عَلَى ٱلْبِغَآءِ إِنْ أَرَدْنَ تَحَصُّنًا لِّتَبْتَغُوا۟ عَرَضَ ٱلْحَيَوٰةِ ٱلدُّنْيَا ۚ وَمَن يُكْرِههُّنَّ فَإِنَّ ٱللَّهَ مِنۢ بَعْدِ إِكْرَٰهِهِنَّ غَفُورٌ رَّحِيمٌ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Those who are unable to marry should keep chaste until God gives them enough out of His bounty. If any of your slaves wish to pay for their freedom, make a contract with them accordingly, if you know they have good in them, and give them some of the wealth God has given you. Do not force your slave-girls into prostitution, when they themselves wish to remain honourable, in your quest for the short-term gains of this world, although, if they are forced, God will be forgiving and merciful to them.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَلْيَسْتَعْفِفِ","en_gloss":"And let be chaste","transliteration":"walyastaʿfifi","verse_key":"24:33"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"those who","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"24:33"},{"pos":3,"ar":"لَا","en_gloss":"(do) not","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"24:33"},{"pos":4,"ar":"يَجِدُونَ","en_gloss":"find","transliteration":"yajidūna","verse_key":"24:33"},{"pos":5,"ar":"نِكَاحًا","en_gloss":"(means for) marriage","transliteration":"nikāḥan","verse_key":"24:33"},{"pos":6,"ar":"حَتَّىٰ","en_gloss":"until","transliteration":"ḥattā","verse_key":"24:33"},{"pos":7,"ar":"يُغْنِيَهُمُ","en_gloss":"Allah enriches them","transliteration":"yugh'niyahumu","verse_key":"24:33"},{"pos":8,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"Allah enriches them","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"24:33"},{"pos":9,"ar":"مِن","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"24:33"},{"pos":10,"ar":"فَضْلِهِۦ ۗ","en_gloss":"His Bounty","transliteration":"faḍlihi","verse_key":"24:33"},{"pos":11,"ar":"وَٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"And those who","transliteration":"wa-alladhīna","verse_key":"24:33"},{"pos":12,"ar":"يَبْتَغُونَ","en_gloss":"seek","transliteration":"yabtaghūna","verse_key":"24:33"},{"pos":13,"ar":"ٱلْكِتَـٰبَ","en_gloss":"the writing","transliteration":"l-kitāba","verse_key":"24:33"},{"pos":14,"ar":"مِمَّا","en_gloss":"from (those) whom","transliteration":"mimmā","verse_key":"24:33"},{"pos":15,"ar":"مَلَكَتْ","en_gloss":"possess","transliteration":"malakat","verse_key":"24:33"},{"pos":16,"ar":"أَيْمَـٰنُكُمْ","en_gloss":"your right hands","transliteration":"aymānukum","verse_key":"24:33"},{"pos":17,"ar":"فَكَاتِبُوهُمْ","en_gloss":"then give them (the) writing","transliteration":"fakātibūhum","verse_key":"24:33"},{"pos":18,"ar":"إِنْ","en_gloss":"if","transliteration":"in","verse_key":"24:33"},{"pos":19,"ar":"عَلِمْتُمْ","en_gloss":"you know","transliteration":"ʿalim'tum","verse_key":"24:33"},{"pos":20,"ar":"فِيهِمْ","en_gloss":"in them","transliteration":"fīhim","verse_key":"24:33"},{"pos":21,"ar":"خَيْرًۭا ۖ","en_gloss":"any good","transliteration":"khayran","verse_key":"24:33"},{"pos":22,"ar":"وَءَاتُوهُم","en_gloss":"and give them","transliteration":"waātūhum","verse_key":"24:33"},{"pos":23,"ar":"مِّن","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"24:33"},{"pos":24,"ar":"مَّالِ","en_gloss":"the wealth of Allah","transliteration":"māli","verse_key":"24:33"},{"pos":25,"ar":"ٱللَّهِ","en_gloss":"the wealth of Allah","transliteration":"l-lahi","verse_key":"24:33"},{"pos":26,"ar":"ٱلَّذِىٓ","en_gloss":"which","transliteration":"alladhī","verse_key":"24:33"},{"pos":27,"ar":"ءَاتَىٰكُمْ ۚ","en_gloss":"He has given you","transliteration":"ātākum","verse_key":"24:33"},{"pos":28,"ar":"وَلَا","en_gloss":"And (do) not","transliteration":"walā","verse_key":"24:33"},{"pos":29,"ar":"تُكْرِهُوا۟","en_gloss":"compel","transliteration":"tuk'rihū","verse_key":"24:33"},{"pos":30,"ar":"فَتَيَـٰتِكُمْ","en_gloss":"your slave girls","transliteration":"fatayātikum","verse_key":"24:33"},{"pos":31,"ar":"عَلَى","en_gloss":"to","transliteration":"ʿalā","verse_key":"24:33"},{"pos":32,"ar":"ٱلْبِغَآءِ","en_gloss":"[the] prostitution","transliteration":"l-bighāi","verse_key":"24:33"},{"pos":33,"ar":"إِنْ","en_gloss":"if","transliteration":"in","verse_key":"24:33"},{"pos":34,"ar":"أَرَدْنَ","en_gloss":"they desire","transliteration":"aradna","verse_key":"24:33"},{"pos":35,"ar":"تَحَصُّنًۭا","en_gloss":"chastity","transliteration":"taḥaṣṣunan","verse_key":"24:33"},{"pos":36,"ar":"لِّتَبْتَغُوا۟","en_gloss":"that you may seek","transliteration":"litabtaghū","verse_key":"24:33"},{"pos":37,"ar":"عَرَضَ","en_gloss":"temporary gain","transliteration":"ʿaraḍa","verse_key":"24:33"},{"pos":38,"ar":"ٱلْحَيَوٰةِ","en_gloss":"(of) the life","transliteration":"l-ḥayati","verse_key":"24:33"},{"pos":39,"ar":"ٱلدُّنْيَا ۚ","en_gloss":"(of) the world","transliteration":"l-dun'yā","verse_key":"24:33"},{"pos":40,"ar":"وَمَن","en_gloss":"And whoever","transliteration":"waman","verse_key":"24:33"},{"pos":41,"ar":"يُكْرِههُّنَّ","en_gloss":"compels them","transliteration":"yuk'rihhunna","verse_key":"24:33"},{"pos":42,"ar":"فَإِنَّ","en_gloss":"then indeed","transliteration":"fa-inna","verse_key":"24:33"},{"pos":43,"ar":"ٱللَّهَ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-laha","verse_key":"24:33"},{"pos":44,"ar":"مِنۢ","en_gloss":"after","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"24:33"},{"pos":45,"ar":"بَعْدِ","en_gloss":"after","transliteration":"baʿdi","verse_key":"24:33"},{"pos":46,"ar":"إِكْرَٰهِهِنَّ","en_gloss":"their compulsion","transliteration":"ik'rāhihinna","verse_key":"24:33"},{"pos":47,"ar":"غَفُورٌۭ","en_gloss":"(is) Oft-Forgiving","transliteration":"ghafūrun","verse_key":"24:33"},{"pos":48,"ar":"رَّحِيمٌۭ","en_gloss":"Most Merciful","transliteration":"raḥīmun","verse_key":"24:33"},{"pos":49,"ar":"٣٣","en_gloss":"(33)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"24:33"}]},{"verse_key":"24:34","surah":24,"ayah":34,"ar_uthmani":"وَلَقَدْ أَنزَلْنَآ إِلَيْكُمْ ءَايَـٰتٍ مُّبَيِّنَـٰتٍ وَمَثَلًا مِّنَ ٱلَّذِينَ خَلَوْا۟ مِن قَبْلِكُمْ وَمَوْعِظَةً لِّلْمُتَّقِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"We have sent verses down to you [people] clarifying the right path, examples of those who passed away before you, and advice for those who are mindful of God.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَلَقَدْ","en_gloss":"And verily","transliteration":"walaqad","verse_key":"24:34"},{"pos":2,"ar":"أَنزَلْنَآ","en_gloss":"We have sent down","transliteration":"anzalnā","verse_key":"24:34"},{"pos":3,"ar":"إِلَيْكُمْ","en_gloss":"to you","transliteration":"ilaykum","verse_key":"24:34"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ءَايَـٰتٍۢ","en_gloss":"Verses","transliteration":"āyātin","verse_key":"24:34"},{"pos":5,"ar":"مُّبَيِّنَـٰتٍۢ","en_gloss":"clear","transliteration":"mubayyinātin","verse_key":"24:34"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وَمَثَلًۭا","en_gloss":"and an example","transliteration":"wamathalan","verse_key":"24:34"},{"pos":7,"ar":"مِّنَ","en_gloss":"of","transliteration":"mina","verse_key":"24:34"},{"pos":8,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"those who","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"24:34"},{"pos":9,"ar":"خَلَوْا۟","en_gloss":"passed away","transliteration":"khalaw","verse_key":"24:34"},{"pos":10,"ar":"مِن","en_gloss":"before you","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"24:34"},{"pos":11,"ar":"قَبْلِكُمْ","en_gloss":"before you","transliteration":"qablikum","verse_key":"24:34"},{"pos":12,"ar":"وَمَوْعِظَةًۭ","en_gloss":"and an admonition","transliteration":"wamawʿiẓatan","verse_key":"24:34"},{"pos":13,"ar":"لِّلْمُتَّقِينَ","en_gloss":"for those who fear (Allah)","transliteration":"lil'muttaqīna","verse_key":"24:34"},{"pos":14,"ar":"٣٤","en_gloss":"(34)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"24:34"}]},{"verse_key":"24:35","surah":24,"ayah":35,"ar_uthmani":"۞ ٱللَّهُ نُورُ ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ وَٱلْأَرْضِ ۚ مَثَلُ نُورِهِۦ كَمِشْكَوٰةٍ فِيهَا مِصْبَاحٌ ۖ ٱلْمِصْبَاحُ فِى زُجَاجَةٍ ۖ ٱلزُّجَاجَةُ كَأَنَّهَا كَوْكَبٌ دُرِّىٌّ يُوقَدُ مِن شَجَرَةٍ مُّبَـٰرَكَةٍ زَيْتُونَةٍ لَّا شَرْقِيَّةٍ وَلَا غَرْبِيَّةٍ يَكَادُ زَيْتُهَا يُضِىٓءُ وَلَوْ لَمْ تَمْسَسْهُ نَارٌ ۚ نُّورٌ عَلَىٰ نُورٍ ۗ يَهْدِى ٱللَّهُ لِنُورِهِۦ مَن يَشَآءُ ۚ وَيَضْرِبُ ٱللَّهُ ٱلْأَمْثَـٰلَ لِلنَّاسِ ۗ وَٱللَّهُ بِكُلِّ شَىْءٍ عَلِيمٌ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"God is the Light of the heavens and earth. His Light is like this: there is a niche, and in it a lamp, the lamp inside a glass, a glass like a glittering star, fuelled from a blessed olive tree from neither east nor west, whose oil almost gives light even when no fire touches it- light upon light- God guides whoever He will to his Light; God draws such comparisons for people; God has full knowledge of everything-","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"۞ ٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"al-lahu","verse_key":"24:35"},{"pos":2,"ar":"نُورُ","en_gloss":"(is the) Light","transliteration":"nūru","verse_key":"24:35"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ","en_gloss":"(of) the heavens","transliteration":"l-samāwāti","verse_key":"24:35"},{"pos":4,"ar":"وَٱلْأَرْضِ ۚ","en_gloss":"and the earth","transliteration":"wal-arḍi","verse_key":"24:35"},{"pos":5,"ar":"مَثَلُ","en_gloss":"(The) example","transliteration":"mathalu","verse_key":"24:35"},{"pos":6,"ar":"نُورِهِۦ","en_gloss":"(of) His Light","transliteration":"nūrihi","verse_key":"24:35"},{"pos":7,"ar":"كَمِشْكَوٰةٍۢ","en_gloss":"(is) like a niche","transliteration":"kamish'katin","verse_key":"24:35"},{"pos":8,"ar":"فِيهَا","en_gloss":"in it","transliteration":"fīhā","verse_key":"24:35"},{"pos":9,"ar":"مِصْبَاحٌ ۖ","en_gloss":"(is) a lamp","transliteration":"miṣ'bāḥun","verse_key":"24:35"},{"pos":10,"ar":"